 o dispositivi di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8U0qS9NjJUMQ7kNvwG0Pz9W&_nc_oc=Adovn0rCwkxafYo55m8mf0a4x_zQjHhT3TThOljSqlgwJLTVPX4yWOaJYfdnVXaBCCk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT0Puyd_rk9RR1jzNo8LuU6Wci_fyq_DgttxKlONxwegw&oe=6B0867E3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_dXrKtTHka8Q7kNvwFyZZwG&_nc_oc=AdqsFM0K2fG1JxSFgnWrcgFSY1R5d9Fi8IOoWbjCxqwJqMX9dAeibzrvHgvX8Rx-bwk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQrsMjkHxnqO7fyX0YxDyZlLVIAXccTGoHzgfJSR0obtw&oe=6B0853DD"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vHQl-5E9xEYQ7kNvwF_7PP5&_nc_oc=Adp6_7RDDfGdGCXYv4fo8fmCNg-So9BAAybzddd36Vo4ay12zXYFJfVcyQCXkY4Kv_I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTsnGSj0JXLkhZWs07KI1Ni6r